      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，这都是炒热比赛气氛用的“元素”。\n富士奇石是在重炮的配合下演了这场戏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec4dedfa1fa99388f618b2a9967232fdd6f4b013b91a360292760bbaadbfcab4",
